      "claim": "L5 permeability records show high passive permeability for budesonide and hydrocortisone (C213, C217, C247, C254, C261). Absorption is not permeability-limited for this class. High permeability alone does not establish F≥20% because solubility and first-pass metabolism dominate for lipophilic corticosteroids.",
